    "detailed_description": "<strong>description:</strong>.<br>Join an exciting adventure in the world of Melstroy Survivor! Embark on an epic quest where your control and combat skills will be put to the test in endless battles and dangerous challenges.<br><br><strong>features:</strong><br><br>Simple gameplay, grandiose possibilities: In Melstroy Survivor, control is limited only to your character's movement, but his abilities for battle are unlimited. Kill enemies, collect experience, and pump unique skills to become a true hero.<br><br><strong>Character Upgrades and Equipment:</strong> Prepare your hero for battles by choosing from a wide range of equipment that will give you an edge in battle. Increase your damage, add health, and create a unique fighting style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898940/extras/742988a86d19debc0efb534fcdc354e3.avif?t=1753814833\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><strong>Shop and Roulette:</strong> Visit the store to purchase the best equipment and upgrade items. Try your luck in roulette, where you can win virtual money to buy unique items and unlock new abilities.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898940/extras/5d14625bf339828c5e764fffbc0964c9.avif?t=1753814833\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898940/extras/e43251ea4ead0b05f949f070a45c9c64.avif?t=1753814833\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><br><strong>delightful Graphics And Atmosphere:</strong>.<br>Melstroy Survivor recreates the spirit of retro gaming with beautifully detailed artwork and breathtaking visuals. Immerse yourself in a unique atmosphere and enjoy every moment of your adventure.",
